was beaten with the gun.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.600
They never found them

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.260
and I didn't talk to anybody about it

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.900
but that was the last husband.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:47.760
I've only been married twice.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.850
My first husband,

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:49.950
he tried to kill me

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.620
with his medication.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.520
I don't like to cook, so I am a cleaner.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:56.870
And so he was preparing meals

00:06:56.870 --> 00:07:00.210
and putting his medication in my food.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.860
And by the time I went to the ER

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:02.863
the first time,

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.520
