00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.440
So I got out

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.180
and then my second husband
ended up committing suicide,

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.080
but I'm okay still.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.103
and it's okay.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.070
There's a lot that went on
in between different things

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.560
and I'm just having a hard time

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.010
bringing them out to surface.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.000
My mom ended up coming down with dementia

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.480
and my son hit a trip in his road life

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.600
and decided he didn't wanna speak to me.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:55.110
So in my head, my mother
left me and my son left me

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:59.270
'cause I have a bunch of
psychological dysfunctions,

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.573
depression, PTSD,

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.880
anxiety, so on.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.850
