00:30:04.170 --> 00:30:08.270
And I am who I am and
that's all that it is.

00:30:08.270 --> 00:30:09.703
And if nobody likes it,

00:30:09.703 --> 00:30:12.200
they don't have to be around me

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:15.813
'cause I can be alone and be just fine.

00:30:15.813 --> 00:30:17.139
I learned that.

00:30:17.139 --> 00:30:18.340
If there's anything that I've learned,

00:30:18.340 --> 00:30:20.440
the most important thing ever

00:30:20.440 --> 00:30:23.050
is not how to fight to survive.

00:30:23.050 --> 00:30:25.230
Try to live without anybody

00:30:26.430 --> 00:30:27.750
'cause you can't get hurt

00:30:27.750 --> 00:30:29.510
and what's already hurt

00:30:29.510 --> 00:30:32.800
begins to heal enough to be able to smile.

00:30:32.800 --> 00:30:35.670
Every morning, grab
this world by the balls

00:30:35.670 --> 00:30:39.120
and smile and laugh and
make people laugh all day

00:30:39.120 --> 00:30:41.350
because everybody wants to be miserable

00:30:41.350 --> 00:30:43.383
and that's too fucking easy.

00:30:47.320 --> 00:30:48.500
- [Mark] All right, Glow.

00:30:48.500 --> 00:30:49.930
Thank you so much for
telling me your story.

00:30:49.930 --> 00:30:50.763
- You're welcome

00:30:51.980 --> 00:30:55.490
and I hope it was whatever
it needs for whoever sees it.

00:30:55.490 --> 00:30:57.540
- [Mark] Yeah, it's very powerful.

00:30:57.540 --> 00:31:00.030
You've been through a lot.

00:31:00.030 --> 00:31:01.390
- Yeah, well, we all have.

00:31:01.390 --> 00:31:02.630
- [Mark] Thank you for sharing it.

00:31:02.630 --> 00:31:03.463
- You're welcome.

00:31:03.463 --> 00:31:04.683
Thank you for asking me.

00:31:10.210 --> 00:31:11.460
Oh, where's my vodka?

00:31:11.460 --> 00:31:12.573
I needed my coffee.

